PROJECT NAME:
CODEX – AI Interview Simulator

PROJECT TYPE:
AI-Powered Full-Stack Interview Practice Platform

OBJECTIVE:
Develop a complete web-based AI Interview Simulator that provides realistic
Technical and HR mock interviews for students and job seekers.

The platform must generate interview questions, collect candidate answers,
evaluate answers using AI, calculate scores, provide detailed feedback,
identify skill gaps, recommend learning resources, and maintain interview
history and performance analytics.

